  "anchor": "Per-sector turnover bands in USD per year, framework adopted from the Small Business Benchmarks model. Each sector gets three bands: small / medium / large. Phase 2 (2026-05-26) extended from 6 sentinel sectors to all 25 with sector-calibrated thresholds. Thresholds anchored to: (a) observed cells_master quantiles where data exists, (b) sector economics (capital intensity, per-employee revenue scale) elsewhere. Currency conversion to local USD-equivalent happens at render time via the country PPP factor.",
